<hgroup><h1>Biochemical Evidence for Formate Transfer in Syntrophic Propionate-Oxidizing Cocultures of <em>Syntrophobacter fumaroxidans</em> and <em>Methanospirillum hungatei</em>
</h1></hgroup><div class="cg p">
<a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="de%20Bok%20FAM"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id1"><span class="name western">Frank A M de Bok</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id1">
<h3><span class="name western">Frank A M de Bok</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Laboratory of Microbiology, Wageningen University, The Netherlands</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="de%20Bok%20FAM"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Frank A M de Bok</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1,</sup><sup>*</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Luijten%20MLGC"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id2"><span class="name western">Maurice L G C Luijten</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id2">
<h3><span class="name western">Maurice L G C Luijten</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Laboratory of Microbiology, Wageningen University, The Netherlands</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Luijten%20MLGC"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Maurice L G C Luijten</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>, <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Stams%20AJM"[Author]' class="usa-link" aria-describedby="id3"><span class="name western">Alfons J M Stams</span></a><div hidden="hidden" id="id3">
<h3><span class="name western">Alfons J M Stams</span></h3>
<div class="p">
<sup>1</sup>Laboratory of Microbiology, Wageningen University, The Netherlands</div>
<div class="p">Find articles by <a href='https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term="Stams%20AJM"[Author]' class="usa-link"><span class="name western">Alfons J M Stams</span></a>
</div>
</div>
<sup>1</sup>
</div>
<ul class="d-buttons inline-list">
